f3ria, backorder em vez de venda perdida, pipeline ignorado, arredondamento para baixo no fardo, re-treino di\u00e1rio, baseline estrangulado.", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_pipeline_in_transit", "label": "Regra: in_transit obrigat\u00f3rio", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "in_transit \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio em toda decis\u00e3o porque omitir o pipeline faz a pol\u00edtica pedir de novo o que j\u00e1 est\u00e1 a caminho \u2014 o bug cl\u00e1ssico deste tipo de sistema, que infla o resultado silenciosamente.", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_venda_perdida", "label": "Venda perdida, n\u00e3o backorder", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "sales = min(demand, on_hand); o que n\u00e3o foi atendido \u00e9 venda perdida, n\u00e3o backorder, porque no varejo alimentar o cliente n\u00e3o espera. Modelar como backorder superestima o desempenho de qualquer pol\u00edtica.", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_sprints", "label": "Plano de sprints (0 a 5)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_warmup", "label": "Per\u00edodo de aquecimento (warmup_days)", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Os primeiros warmup_days s\u00e3o simulados mas descartados das m\u00e9tricas, porque sem isso o estoque inicial arbitr\u00e1rio contamina o resultado.", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_stack", "label": "Stack t\u00e9cnico (Python, polars, lightgbm, pydantic, pytest, ruff, mypy)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_no_magic_numbers", "label": "Regra: nenhum n\u00famero m\u00e1gico no c\u00f3digo", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Toda premissa num\u00e9rica (lead time, margem, m\u00faltiplo de fardo, custo de capital, \u03b1 por categoria) vem de config/params.yaml; nenhum n\u00famero m\u00e1gico vive no c\u00f3digo.", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "claude_simulador", "target": "claude_forecaster", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_simulador", "target": "claude_policy", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_policy", "target": "claude_decisioncontext", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_forecaster", "target": "claude_decisioncontext", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_erp_baseline", "target": "claude_policy", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_basestock", "target": "claude_policy", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "claude_forecast_naive", "target": "claude_forecaster", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "con